_:genid44 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n            PREFIX fairo: <https://w3id.org/fair-o#>\n\n            SELECT $this\n            WHERE {\n                $this fairo:testResult fairo:Pass ;\n                      fairo:value ?value .\n                FILTER (?value != 1.0)\n            }\n        " .
_:genid44 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "If testResult is Pass, the value must be exactly 1.0." .
_:genid44 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#SPARQLConstraint> .
<http://w3id.org/fair-o-shapes#SubPrincipleResultShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#sparql> _:genid45 .
_:genid45 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n            PREFIX fairo: <https://w3id.org/fair-o#>\n\n            SELECT $this\n            WHERE {\n                $this fairo:testResult fairo:Fail ;\n                      fairo:value ?value .\n                FILTER (?value != 0.0)\n            }\n        " .
_:genid45 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "If testResult is Fail, the value must be exactly 0.0." .
_:genid45 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#SPARQLConstraint> .
<http://w3id.org/fair-o-shapes#SubPrincipleResultShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#sparql> _:genid46 .
_:genid46 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n            PREFIX fairo: <https://w3id.org/fair-o#>\n\n            SELECT $this\n            WHERE {\n                $this fairo:testResult fairo:Indeterminate ;\n                      fairo:value ?value .\n                FILTER (?value <= 0.0 || ?value >= 1.0)\n            }\n        " .
_:genid46 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "If testResult is Indeterminate, the value must be greater than 0 and less than 1." .
_:genid46 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#SPARQLConstraint> .
<http://w3id.org/fair-o-shapes#SubPrincipleResultShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#sparql> _:genid47 .
_:genid47 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n            PREFIX fairo: <https://w3id.org/fair-o#>\n\n            SELECT $this\n            WHERE {\n                $this fairo:forSubPrinciple ?subPrinciple ;\n                      fairo:assessmentScope ?resultScope .\n\n                ?subPrinciple fairo:appliesTo ?expectedScope .\n\n                FILTER (?resultScope != ?expectedScope)\n            }\n        " .
_:genid47 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "The assessment scope of a sub-principle result must be consistent with the scope declared for the corresponding FAIR sub-principle, when such scope is declared." .
_:genid47 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#SPARQLConstraint> .
<http://w3id.org/fair-o-shapes#SubPrincipleResultShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#sparql> _:genid48 .
_:genid48 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n            PREFIX fairo: <https://w3id.org/fair-o#>\n\n            SELECT $this\n            WHERE {\n                $this fairo:computedUsing ?algorithm .\n                FILTER (\n                    NOT EXISTS { ?algorithm fairo:appliesScoringFunction ?scoringFunction . }\n                    ||\n                    NOT EXISTS { ?algorithm fairo:implementedBy ?softwareAgent . }\n                )\n            }\n        " .
_:genid48 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Each sub-principle result must have a complete computation chain: calculation algorithm, scoring function, and implementing software agent." .
_:genid48 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#SPARQLConstraint> .
